title: Sovereignty partners turn on each other
subtitle: ERC and [+ parlament_current_ciu +] have yet to reach a proper agreement to form government, but who's to blame?
tags: event
role: event
new-page: true
view-if: not rubicon and parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase > 1 and coalition_phase_timer > 0 and (not parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mediation_round or parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mediation_round < parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) and (parlament_coalition_sovereignty_feud > 0 or (parlament_current_ciu = "ciu" and ciu_relations < 45) or (parlament_current_ciu = "cdc" and cdc_relations < 45) or (parlament_current_ciu = "dl" and dl_relations < 45) or (parlament_current_ciu = "pdcat" and pdcat_relations < 45) or (parlament_current_ciu = "junts" and junts_relations < 45) or (parlament_current_ciu = "jxcat" and jxcat_relations < 45))
face-image: img/events/disputa_erc_junts.webp

= The Sovereignty partners turn on each other

The negotiation delegations of ERC and [+ parlament_current_ciu +] are blaming one another for the failed negotiations round as common trust seems to be hitting new lows.

[? if player_party = "erc": Whatever we do now, may very well decide the immediate future of our relations.?]
[? if player_party = "cup": If the investiture is to survive, we may have to intervene in this partners' quarrel by themselves.?]

- @erc_compromise
- @erc_escalate
- @cup_mediate
- @cup_erc
- @cup_ciu

@erc_compromise
title: Offer [+ parlament_current_ciu +] a compromise
view-if: player_party = "erc"
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase <= 1 || Q.coalition_phase_timer <= 0 || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mediation_round >= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) return;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_action = "mediate";
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_feud = Math.max(0, Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_feud - 1);
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] += 6;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute.resolve

@erc_escalate
title: Push them to accept our positions!
view-if: player_party = "erc"
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase <= 1 || Q.coalition_phase_timer <= 0 || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mediation_round >= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) return;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_action = "escalate";
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_feud += 2;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 6;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute.resolve

@cup_mediate
title: Push to bring them both back to a common proposal
view-if: player_party = "cup"
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase <= 1 || Q.coalition_phase_timer <= 0 || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mediation_round >= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) return;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_action = "mediate";
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_feud = Math.max(0, Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_feud - 1);
    Q.erc_relations += 3;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] += 3;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute.resolve

@cup_erc
title: Back ERC
view-if: player_party = "cup"
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase <= 1 || Q.coalition_phase_timer <= 0 || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mediation_round >= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) return;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_action = "escalate";
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_feud += 1;
    Q.erc_relations += 5;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] -= 5;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute.resolve

@cup_ciu
title: Back [+ parlament_current_ciu +]
view-if: player_party = "cup"
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase <= 1 || Q.coalition_phase_timer <= 0 || Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_mediation_round >= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase) return;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute_action = "escalate";
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_feud += 1;
    Q.erc_relations -= 5;
    Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_relations"] += 5;
!}
go-to: parlament_coalition_sovereignty_dispute.resolve
